<!doctype lake><title>🐿️ 𝓣𝓱𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="zpR0z" id="zpR0z" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9de8a452" id="u9de8a452"> </span><span data-lake-id="ubb7d59f2" id="ubb7d59f2">🐦‍🔥</span><span data-lake-id="u05fba0f7" id="u05fba0f7"> 𝓒𝓱𝓪𝓲𝓷 𝓸𝓯 𝓟𝓻𝓮𝓯𝓮𝓻𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷: 𝓘𝓶𝓹𝓻𝓸𝓿𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓒𝓱𝓪𝓲𝓷-𝓸𝓯-𝓣𝓱𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱𝓽 𝓡𝓮𝓪𝓼𝓸𝓷𝓲𝓷𝓰 𝓲𝓷 𝓛𝓛𝓜𝓼</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5ca5981a" id="u5ca5981a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9da88c52" id="u9da88c52" style="color: #DF2A3F">研究动机与问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u63981e95"><li fid="ubea103d9" data-lake-id="u53477e43" id="u53477e43"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5e10153e" id="u5e10153e">CoT 的局限性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0d1ffd7" id="ud0d1ffd7"> 尽管 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73b497cc" id="u73b497cc">Chain-of-Thought (CoT)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub53bb31b" id="ub53bb31b">能让 LLMs 生成明确的中间推论步骤，显著提高问题解决能力，但它本质上是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u07f45d89" id="u07f45d89">单路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u69bde7e4" id="u69bde7e4">的，常会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u754b75ca" id="u754b75ca">错过最优推论路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99379deb" id="u99379deb">，表现出无意识的回答风格</span></li><li fid="ubea103d9" data-lake-id="udd121a6f" id="udd121a6f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uccb7bc04" id="uccb7bc04">ToT 的高成本：Tree-of-Thought (ToT)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3180699e" id="u3180699e">通过在每一步生成</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e4a73d6" id="u6e4a73d6">多个分支思路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8b4385b6" id="u8b4385b6">（thoughts）并进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uef3fc56e" id="uef3fc56e">自我评估、剪枝和规划</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0a090480" id="u0a090480">，来搜索更佳的推论路径。虽然 ToT 提高推论质量，但其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u062167c7" id="u062167c7">显著增加计算复杂度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4ad17006" id="u4ad17006">，限制实际应用</span></li><li fid="ubea103d9" data-lake-id="ufd1c3fc2" id="ufd1c3fc2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uee862f2f" id="uee862f2f" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">核心问题：如何在保持 CoT 效率的同时，整合 ToT 的战略深度？</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5ba1f4d0" id="u5ba1f4d0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7df2581c" id="u7df2581c" style="color: #AD1A2B">现有方法的局限性</span></strong></p><ul list="uc16ed30e"><li fid="u37bb3b2f" data-lake-id="ud4385446" id="ud4385446"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6949342e" id="u6949342e">自然策略：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub2dfd84c" id="ub2dfd84c">现有的方法通常是将 ToT 发现的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4e8b5ea" id="ud4e8b5ea">最佳推论路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufc86aea9" id="ufc86aea9">作为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud636e797" id="ud636e797">监督目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u61e5afc4" id="u61e5afc4">，对 LLMs 进行微调</span></li><li fid="u37bb3b2f" data-lake-id="ub93acca1" id="ub93acca1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e1ca34f" id="u0e1ca34f">缺陷：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc295f211" id="uc295f211">这些方法</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u13b00d96" id="u13b00d96">忽略树搜索过程中产生的非最优思路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16f7523f" id="u16f7523f">。ToT 在每一步都会生成多个备选思路并进行剪枝，这自然地构成所有中间候选思路的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u35088969" id="u35088969">偏好信息</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uae52d1ed" id="uae52d1ed">（即被选入最佳路径的思路优于未被选入的）。这种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a2c0188" id="u2a2c0188">非最优推论路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02c11222" id="u02c11222">和偏好信息蕴含比最终最佳路径</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucacde2de" id="ucacde2de">更多的洞察</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u86dda0dc" id="u86dda0dc">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7f3ee2f1" id="u7f3ee2f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d54c595" id="u9d54c595" style="color: #AD1A2B">Chain-of-Preference Optimization (CPO)</span></strong></p><ul list="u79fdf049"><li fid="u30710e8d" data-lake-id="u2f2e8b2b" id="u2f2e8b2b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u581540f4" id="u581540f4">核心机制：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ube5afc71" id="ube5afc71">CPO 受 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3d6d981" id="ue3d6d981">Direct Preference Optimization (DPO)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5f6918f1" id="u5f6918f1"> 等 RLHF 技术的启发，旨在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d4cd80b" id="u9d4cd80b">充分利用 ToT 搜索树中固有的偏好信息</span></strong></li><li fid="u30710e8d" data-lake-id="u56c814d1" id="u56c814d1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u653a6dd3" id="u653a6dd3">数据构建：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubc9b35bb" id="ubc9b35bb">CPO 根据 ToT 的搜索树，在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ee74673" id="u8ee74673">每个推论步骤</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u01b9a1e4" id="u01b9a1e4">构建</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf59654bf" id="uf59654bf">配对的偏好思路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u210c3da5" id="u210c3da5">（preferred and dispreferred thoughts）。具体来说，出现在 ToT 最终路径中的思路被视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uce13377a" id="uce13377a">偏好思路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8583b00b" id="u8583b00b">，未出现的则被视为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u94f865a0" id="u94f865a0">不偏好思路</span></strong></li><li fid="u30710e8d" data-lake-id="u78866ac0" id="u78866ac0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5e79e51" id="ua5e79e51">微调目标：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0244f4d1" id="u0244f4d1">CPO 使用 DPO 算法训练 LLMs，使其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uab2b1e47" id="uab2b1e47">对齐</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2f84589f" id="u2f84589f"> ToT 产生的这些偏好，从而使 LLMs 在推理时能</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb5ee61c" id="ubb5ee61c">使用 CoT 解码生成 ToT 偏好的路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u90b4ab37" id="u90b4ab37">​</span></li><li fid="u30710e8d" data-lake-id="u716d2bec" id="u716d2bec"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9458879b" id="u9458879b">优势：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubc8f3769" id="ubc8f3769">CPO 避免 ToT 高昂的推理负担，通过 CoT 实现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u792b54a9" id="u792b54a9">相似甚至更优的性能</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u69e1c9c8" id="u69e1c9c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf5b0359" id="ucf5b0359" style="color: #AD1A2B">实验结论</span></strong></p><ul list="u1c186b00"><li fid="u36c437e4" data-lake-id="ue4783efc" id="ue4783efc"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaaad2b69" id="uaaad2b69">显著提升：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8e6fde6" id="ud8e6fde6">CPO 极大地提高 LLM 解决各种复杂问题的性能，相对于基线模型，平均准确率提升高达 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue988e800" id="ue988e800">4.3%</span></strong></li><li fid="u36c437e4" data-lake-id="u51f0255c" id="u51f0255c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u274b557d" id="u274b557d">任务泛化性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u95669c6a" id="u95669c6a">实验结果证实 CPO 在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e31250f" id="u9e31250f">问答、事实核查和算术推论</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u10efb075" id="u10efb075">等多种复杂问题上均有效</span></li><li fid="u36c437e4" data-lake-id="u2488c32e" id="u2488c32e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue252ec44" id="ue252ec44">模型兼容性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u53e56581" id="u53e56581">实验使用 LLaMA 和 Mistral 作为基础模型，证明 CPO 的有效性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue1894d4a" id="ue1894d4a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1759053073514-45f20e4a-c05b-4701-baa3-ed56609bb2d1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u11ea3920-e8f1-4ee4-a36a-0a3183a2f94%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u54fc37f0-0462-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A885.8181818181819%2C%22height%22%3A393%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A227845%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1218%2C%22originHeight%22%3A540%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22THROUAHTOTANDTHENTUNINGLLMVIADPO.%22%2C%22x%22%3A545%2C%22y%22%3A499%2C%22width%22%3A377%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)CHAINOFPREFERENCEOPTIMIZATION(CPO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A679%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A392%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLLECTINGPREFERENCEDATA(OFEACHSTEP)%22%2C%22x%22%3A547%2C%22y%22%3A473%2C%22width%22%3A363%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)TREEOFTHOUGHT(TOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A225%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELECTEDTHOUGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A474%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTCOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING.%22%2C%22x%22%3A387%2C%22y%22%3A473%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A831%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMEASCOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1085%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ACHAINOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A850%2C%22y%22%3A358%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRUNEDTHOUAHTS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A836%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNFERENCE%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A1084%2C%22y%22%3A474%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNFERENCE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A502%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1009%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A307%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A269%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A637%2C%22y%22%3A440%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A869%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1105%2C%22y%22%3A432%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A560%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A637%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A510%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A174%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%85%22%2C%22x%22%3A831%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A896%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2d6c2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u92ebfee1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="dtUVN" id="dtUVN" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ude73e9e7" id="ude73e9e7"> </span><span data-lake-id="u3978f6d9" id="u3978f6d9">🏘️</span><span data-lake-id="ucc37ff1b" id="ucc37ff1b"> 𝓡𝓮𝓵𝓪𝓽𝓮𝓭 𝓦𝓸𝓻𝓴</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u34a8ae71" id="u34a8ae71"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8b86c4b6" id="u8b86c4b6" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">一言以蔽之：CPO 的贡献是训练期吸收 ToT 的搜索智慧，推理期仍用轻量 CoT，并通过步级偏好对齐充分利用搜索树中的信息</span></strong></p><ul list="u43518765"><li fid="u7e0d3126" data-lake-id="u63a30c59" id="u63a30c59"><strong><span data-lake-id="u413b371a" id="u413b371a">LLMs 推理范式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u39998a06" id="u39998a06">：多步推理能显著提升性能；改进路径包括对 CoT 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u47de9970" id="u47de9970">后编辑</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4ac42f1c" id="u4ac42f1c">或接入</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7559a136" id="u7559a136">外部知识</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub612c04e" id="ub612c04e">，以及将线性推理改为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udd624225" id="udd624225">树/图结构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub123996c" id="ub123996c">并结合搜索（如 DFS/ToT）。缺点是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u32b9e42c" id="u32b9e42c">推理期必须搜索</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua113dd22" id="ua113dd22">，导致</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uffc64d0e" id="uffc64d0e">延迟高</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub45d0a59" id="ub45d0a59">；CPO 则把搜索带来的深思熟虑</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u992e0430" id="u992e0430">前移到训练期</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33bf1a9a" id="u33bf1a9a">​</span></li><li fid="u7e0d3126" data-lake-id="ude545b3d" id="ude545b3d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u609451e5" id="u609451e5">LLM 自我改进</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue08d868d" id="ue08d868d">：RLHF 将模型视作 RL 智能体；自我生成数据的强化式自训练可逐步扩充高质量样本，但多依赖</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6867ab8d" id="u6867ab8d">外部奖励模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u405c7fec" id="u405c7fec">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub0d8bf8f" id="ub0d8bf8f">标注数据</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u171a635e" id="u171a635e">。也有自评打分（self-rewarding）思路，仍需</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d3310f9" id="u6d3310f9">种子标注</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf80c6a0e" id="uf80c6a0e">。CPO 的差异在于：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u38df49f0" id="u38df49f0">不依赖人工真值/外部奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f6a279d" id="u1f6a279d">，直接利用树搜索过程中</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2f585f0" id="ud2f585f0">天然的偏好信号</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2992b14c" id="u2992b14c">，并以链式（逐步）对齐推理</span></li><li fid="u7e0d3126" data-lake-id="u1f58689e" id="u1f58689e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u02a4dfdd" id="u02a4dfdd">MCTS 与 LLM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7dbbbbe2" id="u7dbbbbe2">：MCTS 能平衡探索/利用、增强解码质量，但推理</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d558157" id="u8d558157">时延昂贵</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5c1ebd3c" id="u5c1ebd3c">。有方法用 MCTS 找到的路径做监督微调，通常还需要</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uec833c28" id="uec833c28">额外的策略/价值模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u98021db5" id="u98021db5">与标注。CPO 则</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ff158b2" id="u1ff158b2">无需额外模型与人工标注</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf7a39a2c" id="uf7a39a2c">，把 ToT 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uddfc3663" id="uddfc3663">偏好对</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub1a13386" id="ub1a13386">整理为训练数据，用 DPO 进行对齐，从而在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u35fae52b" id="u35fae52b">不增加推理复杂度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud7388835" id="ud7388835">的前提下逼近/超越 ToT 的表现</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="KRJj9" id="KRJj9" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u58e24e56" id="u58e24e56">🗽</span><span data-lake-id="u683b98d0" id="u683b98d0">𝓫𝓪𝓬𝓴𝓰𝓻𝓸𝓾𝓷𝓭</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ufb74e77f" id="ufb74e77f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b1b95d7" id="u1b1b95d7" style="color: #AD1A2B">Chain-of-Thought（CoT）Prompting</span></strong></p><ul list="u53d466af"><li fid="u9015ed2b" data-lake-id="ub088e0c6" id="ub088e0c6"><span data-lake-id="u1438b7be" id="u1438b7be">思路：在给出最终答案 y 前，先让模型生成一串</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4ddd11a" id="uf4ddd11a">中间想法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufbb262fc" id="ufbb262fc">（thoughts）</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cz_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbce4235d53ef94c0982ab41d45faabb9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OMojz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92d99ff7" id="u92d99ff7">，形成</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua673250a" id="ua673250a">显式推理链</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4534db51" id="u4534db51">​</span></li><li fid="u9015ed2b" data-lake-id="u3fbf9c35" id="u3fbf9c35"><span data-lake-id="u42a5c7ba" id="u42a5c7ba">过程：按序采样 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%20z_%7B%3Ci%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f7cb9eda14ca560c48d639a0e04632b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Custu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5434e8b" id="ua5434e8b">，最后再从 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%20z_%7B1%3An%7D)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff171407e820601d15cfa1a57f74ba076.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z6iXZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf72d3a98" id="uf72d3a98"> 生成 y</span></li><li fid="u9015ed2b" data-lake-id="u2f4e4ae1" id="u2f4e4ae1"><span data-lake-id="ue4290fa6" id="ue4290fa6">提示方式：在输入 x 中放入</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u881e00d2" id="u881e00d2">示例级 CoT 演示</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b061bfa" id="u7b061bfa">作为样例，帮助模型学到先想后答的格式与步进逻辑</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uccea42f8" id="uccea42f8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u45d7bf9e" id="u45d7bf9e" style="color: #AD1A2B">Tree-of-Thought（ToT）Prompting</span></strong></p><ul list="u4f77e806"><li fid="u4c07d07d" data-lake-id="u4798cb21" id="u4798cb21"><span data-lake-id="u973c6ba5" id="u973c6ba5">把推理视作</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4221aef" id="uf4221aef">树搜索</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ube1f180f" id="ube1f180f">：每个结点是一步 thought。包含两组件：</span></li></ul><ol list="u954da940" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u8bf9fca0" data-lake-id="u8a9a5825" id="u8a9a5825"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3427a921" id="u3427a921">thought generator</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u18a5f9c4" id="u18a5f9c4">：基于当前状态生成若干候选 thought</span></li><li fid="u8bf9fca0" data-lake-id="u94435755" id="u94435755"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueaeb119f" id="ueaeb119f">state evaluator</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc2189a95" id="uc2189a95">：给候选打分，选出前 n 个继续扩展</span></li></ol><ul list="u4f77e806" start="2"><li fid="u4c07d07d" data-lake-id="u6eede249" id="u6eede249"><span data-lake-id="ue635717d" id="ue635717d">用 BFS/DFS 等在优选分支上扩展，直到得到最终结论。优势是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u67f93536" id="u67f93536">更审慎</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0af6e873" id="u0af6e873">、能找到更优路径；代价是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d91020d" id="u3d91020d">推理复杂度与时延显著上升</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u11a862bc" id="u11a862bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66e82e14" id="u66e82e14" style="color: #AD1A2B">Direct Preference Optimization（DPO）</span></strong></p><ul list="uaf11a961"><li fid="uc867536b" data-lake-id="u6fa2ac46" id="u6fa2ac46"><span data-lake-id="u3585d46b" id="u3585d46b">目的：直接用偏好数据对齐 LLM，而不是走奖励建模 + RL 微调的两阶段 RLHF 流程。</span></li><li fid="uc867536b" data-lake-id="u3d9d2854" id="u3d9d2854"><span data-lake-id="ue0d56814" id="ue0d56814">数据：对同一输入 x，收集成对生成 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Chat%20y_1%2C%5C%5Chat%20y_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec5e3bcf630aa9cfa45589d5690fd40c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q74lM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6774b54c" id="u6774b54c">，并按某标准打分排序，得到偏好对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%20y_w%20%5C%5Csucc%20%5C%5Chat%20y_l%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb7bf6eb5d63ac487197d5db6eaac4503.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ITqF3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b1ce269" id="u6b1ce269">（赢家/输家）</span></li><li fid="uc867536b" data-lake-id="u4735a9e4" id="u4735a9e4"><span data-lake-id="u167f98ce" id="u167f98ce">目标：最大化模型在赢家上的对数几率、压低输家的对数几率，同时通过与参考模型 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bref%7D%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcc94dfb0df7e9a02d32533ab9a713bdd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UdWR4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf221ebb7" id="uf221ebb7"> 的对比项起到“正则/约束”作用；β 控制这种约束强度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u19ddad8d" id="u19ddad8d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%5Cn%3D%20-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Csigma%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%20%20%5C%5Cbeta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D_w%20%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D_w%20%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%20%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D_%5C%5Cell%20%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D_%5C%5Cell%20%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa481c93c22c0031851df983f805dc304.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VNLh1%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="AE44O" id="AE44O" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2f4f4f01" id="u2f4f4f01"> </span><span data-lake-id="u8233f3be" id="u8233f3be">🕋</span><span data-lake-id="u90a579ef" id="u90a579ef"> 𝓞𝓾𝓻 𝓜𝓮𝓽𝓱𝓸𝓭: 𝓒𝓱𝓪𝓲𝓷𝓸𝓯 𝓟𝓻𝓮𝓯𝓮𝓻𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u83d8af34" id="u83d8af34"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bd722e6" id="u5bd722e6" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)">CPO 的核心思想是，在推理过程的每一步，都利用对不同思路（thoughts）的偏好信息来训练模型。这与以往只学习完整正确推理路径的方法不同。CPO 认为，在解决问题的探索过程中，那些最终未被采纳的非最优思路其实是宝贵的负反馈信号，可以帮助模型学会如何分辨好坏，从而做出更优的决策</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub4332a6a" id="ub4332a6a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1759115894241-90c9be98-17c3-4108-81fc-4750f535c399.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5647127f-a5ef-445a-8acf-51b1e0c4687%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0ee63a34-a05c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A711.2%2C%22height%22%3A306%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A196482%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A889%2C%22originHeight%22%3A383%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANSWERTHEGUESTION%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LSTHATTHOUGHTHELPFULTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A224%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVALUATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BFS%2BPRUNING%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A747%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ISPREFERRED%22%2C%22x%22%3A672%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLMSELF%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%9E%E5%9B%9EE%22%2C%22x%22%3A321%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%9E%E7%99%BDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLLECTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A486%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2222%22%2C%22x%22%3A758%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A674%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A592%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A674%2C%22y%22%3A169%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NEXTSTEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREFERRED%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222E%22%2C%22x%22%3A249%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2211T%22%2C%22x%22%3A672%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%85%22%2C%22x%22%3A739%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORES%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLLECTED%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A671%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A763%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2232%22%2C%22x%22%3A243%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A561%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c5cdc8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u849e47c1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufc1deb6d" id="ufc1deb6d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c9cba5a" id="u7c9cba5a" style="color: #DF2A3F">第一阶段：合成偏好链数据 (Synthesizing Data)。</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u2c6bf6a4" id="u2c6bf6a4" style="color: #E4495B">此阶段的目标是创建一个包含每一步推理的偏好对的数据集 D。该过程模拟思维树的探索过程，具体分为三步：</span></strong></p><ul list="u51f38425"><li fid="u8788bbf0" data-lake-id="u979a355f" id="u979a355f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u99dc9364" id="u99dc9364">思路生成 (Thought Generation)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u955a0ad6" id="u955a0ad6">在推理的每一步，模型会基于当前状态，采样 k 个可能的下一步思路</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5cbaac8b" id="u5cbaac8b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5E%7B(j)%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%3D%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20z_1%2C%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5C%2C%20z_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cnj%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Ck%20.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5718c5b560b59e54c5d0a013bdde6f17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rQNwG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u51f38425" start="2"><li fid="u8788bbf0" data-lake-id="u645f896f" id="u645f896f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u689091af" id="u689091af">状态评估 (State Evaluation)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf02c1a92" id="uf02c1a92">利用 LLM </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ab9a27f" id="u6ab9a27f">自身</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufc48cd51" id="ufc48cd51">来评估包含各个新思路的状态。模型会判断每个思路对于解决问题是可能的还是不可能的，并给出相应的分数，无需外部奖励模型或人工标注</span></li><li fid="u8788bbf0" data-lake-id="u27cfe1be" id="u27cfe1be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b0c7fa5" id="u6b0c7fa5">搜索与收集 (Search and Collection)</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="u75a753d2" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u2df2c2c4" data-lake-id="u8de0379c" id="u8de0379c"><span data-lake-id="u3ad890d0" id="u3ad890d0">使用搜索算法（如广度优先搜索BFS）根据评估分数选出一条最佳的推理路径</span></li><li fid="u2df2c2c4" data-lake-id="u7da8ce85" id="u7da8ce85"><span data-lake-id="u5f124114" id="u5f124114">在这条最佳路径上，每一步的思路被标记为偏好的</span></li><li fid="u2df2c2c4" data-lake-id="u729116b1" id="u729116b1"><span data-lake-id="u5c62d3cd" id="u5c62d3cd">在同一步生成的、但未被选中的其他思路则被标记为不偏好的</span></li><li fid="u2df2c2c4" data-lake-id="u90c2dd05" id="u90c2dd05"><span data-lake-id="u4601f01c" id="u4601f01c">通过这种方式，为推理链条的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9921d25e" id="u9921d25e">每一步</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7aa609a5" id="u7aa609a5">都构建偏好对，形成最终的训练数据集 D</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud3713dc7" id="ud3713dc7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9dc8c957" id="u9dc8c957" style="color: #DF2A3F">第二阶段：使用CPO目标进行训练 (Training)</span></strong></p><ul list="uff464265"><li fid="u1b3dcf06" data-lake-id="uff1ebfb8" id="uff1ebfb8"><span data-lake-id="u82384001" id="u82384001">在获得偏好数据集 D 后，使用一个类似直接偏好优化（DPO）的目标函数来训练模型。其目标是让模型学会为偏好的思路</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5E%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22e28194743aa11059cfb54713227e92.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HeY7Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f8c1f9f" id="u1f8c1f9f">分配更高的生成概率，同时为不偏好的思路 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5E%7Bl%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F386824e13051d8e5d93101200ee52db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22krCTy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4bc125b" id="uc4bc125b"> 分配更低的概率</span></li><li fid="u1b3dcf06" data-lake-id="u854883bb" id="u854883bb"><span data-lake-id="ua315ebbf" id="ua315ebbf">对于推理链条中第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H0TQS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4be52508" id="u4be52508">步的任意一个偏好对，其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8738a775" id="u8738a775">单步损失函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u773d7474" id="u773d7474">定义如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5e40aca8" id="u5e40aca8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%5Cn%3D%20-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Csigma%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%20%20%5C%5Cbeta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%5Cn%20%20%5C%5C%3B-%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%20%20%5C%5Cbeta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(z_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5E%7Bw%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b0730cf5dfe4ff60e580777ae7c1211.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ariHK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u511395ba"><li fid="u4daa6cd0" data-lake-id="u6aab21db" id="u6aab21db"><span data-lake-id="ubd1c65de" id="ubd1c65de">最终，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ef71946" id="u1ef71946">CPO 的总目标函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u18f5db69" id="u18f5db69">就是这个单步损失在整个偏好数据集 D 上的期望（或平均值）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u83ec8c8a" id="u83ec8c8a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%5Cn%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2C%5C%5C%2C%20z_i%5E%7Bw%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%20z_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cell%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7Bi-1%7D%5E%7Bw%7D)%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd005c825d067909d5a6848e686bbe573.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OM5hQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17fc2485" id="u17fc2485"> </span></p><p data-lake-id="u826c865c" id="u826c865c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ubc4be3c8" id="ubc4be3c8">​</span><br></p>